<view class="page"><view class="title">站内更新</view><view class="muted">仅当前页面可见时刷新，失败退避；不承诺后台响铃。外部微信、短信、邮件提醒未配置。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view>本站内未读 {{unread}} · 更新 {{total}}</view><view>{{notice}} 未读不等于待办。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="event_key"><view>{{item.read_at?'已读':'未读'}} · {{item.title}}</view><view>{{item.time}} · 当次状态 {{item.event_status}}</view><button bindtap="open" data-key="{{item.event_key}}" disabled="{{busy}}">重新鉴权查看记录</button><button bindtap="mark" data-key="{{item.event_key}}" disabled="{{busy || item.read_at}}">这条已查看</button></view><button bindtap="previous" disabled="{{busy || page<=1}}">上一页更新</button><button bindtap="next" disabled="{{busy || page*50>=total}}">下一页更新</button><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新更新</button><button bindtap="back">返回</button></view>